### 1. DEVIR over 5000 -> permission denied
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccount": "100001",
  "sourceBranch": "DHAKA-001",
  "destinationAccount": "200001",
  "amount": 6000,
  "debitCredit": "DEBIT",
  "currency": "BDT",
  "exchangeRate": 1,
  "remarks": "Test transfer",
  "userId": "USER-001",
  "transferMode": "DEVIR"
}

### 2. DEVIR at/under 5000 -> allowed, flagged as > 500
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 4000,
  "currency": "BDT",
  "transferMode": "DEVIR"
}

### 3. NORMAL over 500 -> flagged but valid
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 800,
  "currency": "BDT",
  "transferMode": "NORMAL"
}

### 4. Small amount (<= 500) -> no rule fires
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100,
  "currency": "BDT",
  "transferMode": "NORMAL"
}

### 5. Missing amount -> 400 validation error
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transferMode": "NORMAL"
}

### 6. Missing transferMode -> 400 validation error
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 800
}

### 7. Zero / negative amount -> 400 (@Positive)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 0,
  "transferMode": "NORMAL"
}

### 8. Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
